abstract: >-
  Code, processed data and outputs that reproduce every table and figure in
  "Business Applications as a Leading Indicator of New Establishments: Evidence
  from U.S. States That the Relationship Changed After 2020", together with the
  pre-analysis plan, its addenda, and the pre-registered live forecasts for
  2026Q1-Q3.
